        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "Out of the highly successful Don Bradman simulation series comes Don Bradman Cricket JR, the hard-hitting arcade cricket game. Step onto the pitch and feel the thrill of every shot, smash boundaries, outplay opponents and make every run count.\n\nComplete the Bradman Challenge Round and you'll unlock Sir Donald Bradman himself as the captain of the Australian side, along with the Bradman vs Water Tank Mini Game. Easy to pick up…impossible to put down.",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "Procedente de la exitosa serie de simulación Don Bradman, llega Don Bradman Cricket JR, un juego de cricket arcade lleno de golpes contundentes. Sal al campo y siente la emoción de cada golpe, consigue límites, supera a tus rivales y haz que cada carrera cuente.\n\nCompleta la ronda de desafíos Bradman y desbloquearás al mismísimo Sir Donald Bradman como capitán del equipo australiano, además del minijuego Bradman vs Water Tank. Fácil de aprender… ¡imposible de dejar!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2026",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
